title = "maze child"
titleShort = "maze child"
description = "[PAWN_nameDef] grew up in a research camp on a deadworld. [PAWN_possessive] parents were astrobiologists studying mysterious labyrinthine formations beneath the planet's crust. [PAWN_pronoun] spent most of his time wandering those tunnels, wondering what otherworldly entity could have created them."
